<title>USA: NYC $360 mln water bonds yield 5.95 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>NYC $360 mln water bonds yield 5.95 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday it tentatively priced $360.2 million New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority revenue bonds at a top yield of 5.95 percent in the uninsured 2022 maturity.</p>
